            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Falvor King"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Seems that I forgot to mention the xanthan gum. This is meant to be a low calorie dressing made creamy by the xanthan gum. I emailed customer service and they made sure the recipe got corrected.\n\nBy all means, leave out the gum and water if you'd like to make a regular vinaigrette dressing.",
